  <p id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>疾篤，<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0004" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AD">秘</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0006" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0008" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAA">熙</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0010" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAB">濟</persName>等謀共廢<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0015" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>。<persName id="c-jinshu-074-jin098-huan-children:plan:m0017" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>密知之，不敢入。</p>
